# U49 b: Tree view with Sub/allflame_exp_030. Overlay mode: the primary build's viewer drawn in
# the viewport between header and footer with compareSpec = the entry's spec (added/removed
# nodes, compare-only nodes and jewels) and the cursor relative to the tree viewport. Side by
# side (the overlay check box): the divider, the primary tree on the left, the comparison
# build's own viewer and spec on the right (its tree assets, zoom and allocations), input routed
# to the half under the cursor (PageUp/PageDown zoom only that tree), back to overlay.
#! u49-import Sub/allflame_exp_030.xml
#! u49-expect-text ^xFF9922allflame_exp_030
screen 1600 900 dpi 1
fixture userdir=../u46/user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 98
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 428 138
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 476 215
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 1550 260
press PAGEUP
frames 2
move 340 260
press PAGEDOWN
frames 2
move 476 215
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
